all depths pooled: counts mod 9 = [55556, 55556, 55555, 55556, 55555, 55556, 55555, 55556, 55555]; fractions mod 3 = 0.3333, 0.3333, 0.3333 (trivially 1/3 each: every odd u <= X is a node)
